{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地女星田曦薇憑藉《逐玉》、《嫁金釵》等多部話題大劇聲勢暴漲，社交網粉絲數一舉突破1,400萬。</p><p>她日前受邀前往上海商場為汽車品牌站台，現場湧入大批粉絲包圍，連商場高層樓層都擠滿圍觀民眾。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;然而</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T08:25:33.104482+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T08:01:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T08:18:22.631076+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T08:18:22.631076+00:00","content_hash":"b3401ccbdd05ffe3a51d7fc21f75fcee618b3a57104edf4d4ff2e9b9e29cfa34","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}